  "details": "I've seen another post about this, though I just wanted to emphasize the request: I would like a choice to switch items to my left hand. Not use them in my left hand, just keep them there so that I have my right hand--the one desktop users need to \"use\" things--available. Kinda like Minecraft's offhand feature? I just read this request somewhere and saw that it wasn't planned... kinda really thought it was a good idea and I hope y'all implant this eventually <33",
